iencies","concept":"medication","concept_label":"Medication management"},"cms-f0758":{"code":"F-0758","title":"Implement gradual dose reductions(GDR) and non-pharmacological interventions, unless contraindicated, prior to initiating or instead of continuing psychotropic medication; and PRN orders for psychotropic medications are only used when the medication is necessary and PRN use is limited.","category":"Pharmacy Service Deficiencies","concept":"medication","concept_label":"Medication management"},"cms-f0881":{"code":"F-0881","title":"Implement a program that monitors antibiotic use.","category":"Infection Control Deficiencies","concept":"infection_prevention","concept_label":"Infection prevention"},"cms-f0883":{"code":"F-0883","title":"Develop and implement policies and procedures for flu and pneumonia vaccinations.","category":"Infection Control Deficiencies","concept":"infection_prevention","concept_label":"Infection prevention"},"cms-f0656":{"code":"F-0656","title":"Develop and implement a complete care plan that meets all the resident's needs, with timetables and actions that can be measured.","category":"Resident Assessment and Care Planning Deficiencies","concept":"clinical_care","concept_label":"Clinical care"},"cms-f0657":{"code":"F-0657","title":"Develop the complete care plan within 7 days of the comprehensive assessment; and prepared, reviewed, and revised by a team of health professionals.","category":"Resident Assessment and Care Planning Deficiencies","concept":"clinical_care","concept_label":"Clinical care"},"cms-f0740":{"code":"F-0740","title":"Ensure each resident must receive and the facility must provide necessary behavioral health care and services.","category":"Quality of Life and Care Deficiencies","concept":"clinical_care","concept_label":"Clinical care"},"cms-f0842":{"code":"F-0842","title":"Safeguard resident-identifiable information and/or maintain medical records on each resident that are in accordance with accepted professional standards.","category":"Resident Assessment and Care Planning Deficiencies","concept":"clinical_care","concept_label":"Clinical care"},"cms-f0880":{"code":"F-0880","title":"Provide and implement an infection prevention and control program.","category":"Infection Control Deficiencies","concept":"infection_prevention","concept_label":"Infection prevention"},"cms-f0677":{"code":"F-0677","title":"Provide care and assistance to perform activities of daily living for any resident who is unable.","category":"Quality of Life and Care Deficiencies","concept":"clinical_care","concept_label":"Clinical care"},"cms-f0725":{"code":"F-0725","title":"Provide enough nursing staff every day to meet the needs of every resident; and have a licensed nurse in charge on each shift.","category":"Nursing and Physician Services Deficiencies","concept":"staffing","concept_label":"Staffing & supervision"},"cms-f0761":{"code":"F-0761","title":"Ensure drugs and biologicals used in the facility are labeled in accordance with currently accepted professional principles; and all drugs and biologicals must be stored in locked compartments, separately locked, compartments for controlled drugs.","category":"Pharmacy Service Deficiencies","concept":"medication","concept_label":"Medication management"},"cms-f0550":{"code":"F-0550","title":"Honor the resident's right to a dignified existence, self-determination, communication, and to exercise his or her rights.","category":"Resident Rights Deficiencies","concept":"resident_rights","concept_label":"Resident rights & abuse/neglect"},"cms-f0602":{"code":"F-0602","title":"Protect each resident from the wrongful use of the resident's belongings or money.","category":"Freedom from Abuse, Neglect, and Exploitation Deficiencies","concept":"resident_rights","concept_label":"Resident rights & abuse/neglect"},"cms-e0004":{"code":"E-0004","title":"Develop and maintain an Emergency Preparedness Program (EP).","category":"Emergency Preparedness Deficiencies","concept":"emerg